      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.126.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When Jehovah brought back those that returned to Zion,\nWe were like unto them that dream.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.126.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.126.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then was our mouth filled with laughter,\nAnd our tongue with singing:\nThen said they among the nations,\nJehovah hath done great things for them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.126.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.126.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah hath done great things for us,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Whereof",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " we are glad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.126.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.126.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn again our captivity, O Jehovah,\nAs the streams in the South.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.126.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.126.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that sow in tears shall reap in joy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.126.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.126.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that goeth forth and weepeth, bearing seed for sowing,\nShall doubtless come again with joy, bringing his sheaves ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
